1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,445
NFTs are art.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,757
Or are they?

3
00:00:05,433 --> 00:00:07,578
This is how they get sold.

4
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:30,100
But art was never sold like this.

5
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:31,260
AUCTIONEER: One thousand.

6
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,810
AUCTIONEER: One thousand and one.

7
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:34,233
AUCTIONEER: Two thousand.

8
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,055
BIDDER: Ten thousand!

9
00:00:37,708 --> 00:00:39,495
BIDDER: Ten thousand… and one.

10
00:00:39,758 --> 00:00:40,847
AUCTIONEER: Sold.

11
00:00:42,383 --> 00:00:43,757
NEIGHBOUR: Cheeky boy.

12
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:47,363
At Cloak, we take it one step further.

13
00:00:50,325 --> 00:00:52,035
Every bid is sealed.

14
00:00:52,075 --> 00:00:54,257
Nobody sees anyone else's.

15
00:00:54,883 --> 00:00:56,443
Not the other bidders.

16
00:00:56,483 --> 00:00:57,643
Not the bots.

17
00:00:57,683 --> 00:00:59,136
Not even us.

18
00:00:59,483 --> 00:01:02,543
When bidding closes, every bid opens at once.

19
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:04,343
The highest bids win.

20
00:01:04,383 --> 00:01:06,991
And every winner pays the same price.

21
00:01:10,425 --> 00:01:13,422
NFT sealed drops. Live on Cloak.
